    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated within the ever-popular and sought-after Mill Meadows development, this beautifully presented extended three-bedroom family home comes to the market in excellent walk-in condition throughout. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation and having been carefully maintained by its current owners, No. 9 is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. Conveniently situated within walking distance of schools, shops, supermarkets, sporting facilities, public transport links and all town amenities, the property also benefits from easy access to the M11 motorway, making it an ideal choice for both families and commuters. Externally, the property enjoys a beautifully landscaped rear garden finished with porcelain tiling and attractive planting, creating a low-maintenance outdoor space that can be enjoyed year-round. To the front, a tarmacadam driveway provides off-street parking, while side and rear access add further convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.31m x 2.66m\nTiled flooring, feature spiral staircase, guest WC, and access to the main living accommodation.\n\nGuest WC - \nWC and wash hand basin.\n\nLiving Room - 5.49m x 5.03m\nBright reception room with large front-facing window, feature tiled fireplace, and built-in stove.\n\nKitchen - 9.89m x 2.63m\nExtended Kitchen, fitted with a range of floor and wall units and tiled flooring.\n\nDining Room - 3.68m x 3.11m\nSpacious dining area with double doors opening onto the rear garden.\n\nLanding - 2.63m x 2.13m\nLaminate flooring and access to all first-floor accommodation.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.46m x 5.45m\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, ensuite, and views towards Croghan Mountain.\n\nEnsuite - 2.00m x 1.38m\nWC, wash hand basin, and shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.77m x 3.01m\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.77m x 2.75m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of property.\n\nBathroom - 2.91m x 1.54m\nBath, shower, WC, wash hand basin, tiled flooring, and partially tiled walls.\n\nGarden - \nExternally, the property enjoys a beautifully landscaped rear garden finished with porcelain tiling and attractive planting, creating a low-maintenance outdoor space that can be enjoyed year-round.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Presented in walk-in condition </li><li> New alarm system </li><li> Gas-fired central heating </li><li> Master bedroom with ensuite </li><li> Off-street parking </li><li> Landscaped rear garden with porcelain tiling </li><li> Side access and rear access </li><li> Views towards Croghan Mountain </li><li> Close to schools, shops, and local amenities </li><li> Sought-after residential development</ul>"
      },
      {
